policy.json and skills/opensensor-nono/SKILL.md are adapted from the kilo
pack in nolabs-ai/nono-packs (Apache-2.0), inspected at commit
3199292d2149d5c788a16a5ff1495676e58ea095:
https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono-packs/tree/3199292d2149d5c788a16a5ff1495676e58ea095/kilo

OpenSensor changes include XDG-aware paths, dedicated Kilo state and temporary
storage, an explicit inherited-environment allowlist, independent skill and
profile identity, a launcher, runtime checks, and release automation.

dashboard/ contains the OpenSensor Kilo workspace dashboard, including project
policies, keyring integration, browser terminals, and runtime network controls.
It is maintained under this repository's Apache-2.0 license. Its dependencies
are installed separately through npm and retain their own licenses.

This community-maintained integration is independent of nolabs-ai and Kilo.
Kilo and nono are separate dependencies and are not distributed in this pack.
